{% comment %}
  Oberndoerfer Milano - lifestyle tile inside the product grid (2026-08-18, two-tile 2026-08-19)
  Miu Miu mosaic pattern: a full-bleed lifestyle photograph occupies one grid
  cell among the product cards. Rendered from sections/main-collection.liquid
  on page 1: tile 1 after the third product (right edge of row one), tile 2
  after the fifteenth (left edge of row five) so the accents sit asymmetric.

  Image sources: collection metafields custom.editorial_image and
  custom.editorial_image_2 (file_reference). Collections without a value
  render nothing. No text on the photograph.
{% endcomment %}
{%- if tile == 2 -%}
  {%- assign gi = collection.metafields.custom.editorial_image_2 -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign gi = collection.metafields.custom.editorial_image -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if gi != blank -%}
  <li class="product-grid__item obm-grid-lifestyle" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;list-style:none;min-height:100%">
    <style>
      .obm-grid-lifestyle img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
    </style>
    {{ gi.value | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: gi.value.alt }}
  </li>
{%- endif -%}
